"transposabilite": "Brussels has comparable experience with the Pentagon traffic plan (Good Move, 2022) and the calmed cells, but no independent, published air-traffic evaluation, even though Brussels Environment operates the monitoring network and Brussels Mobility holds the traffic counts. Commissioning a before/after evaluation from Brussels Environment, with publication, is achievable without significant budget or legislative change. Strong transferability.",
